    "name": "Force of Will",
    "steam_appid": 3050250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Will&quot; and his alien buddies are paying an innocent school on Earth a visit for some routine abductions - or at least they were, before Will got ejected from the Mothership after a malfunction! Get Will back to his friends before they leave him behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2.5D physics-based patience-testing platformer, you'll use Will's tiny escape UFO to navigate the school and get back to the Mothership. One side of his tiny UFO creates a pushing Force, while the other side creates a pulling Force. You'll have to carefully maneuver Will's tiny UFO so these Forces can propel him through many treacherous obstacles, which are currently suspended in mid-air by the Mothership's malfunctioning tractor beam! Who knew abduction would be this tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One side of Will's capsule repels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.poster.avif?t=1727266555\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.webm?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.mp4?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the other attracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.poster.avif?t=1727266555\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.webm?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.mp4?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To maneuver Will, all you have to do is move your mouse to change his orientation, and right-click to swap the direction of the Forces. Sounds simple enough, right...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the top? Will the school prove too difficult for you to navigate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way to find out if you have the Force of Will.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Will&quot; and his alien buddies are paying an innocent school on Earth a visit for some routine abductions - or at least they were, before Will got ejected from the Mothership after a malfunction! Get Will back to his friends before they leave him behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2.5D physics-based patience-testing platformer, you'll use Will's tiny escape UFO to navigate the school and get back to the Mothership. One side of his tiny UFO creates a pushing Force, while the other side creates a pulling Force. You'll have to carefully maneuver Will's tiny UFO so these Forces can propel him through many treacherous obstacles, which are currently suspended in mid-air by the Mothership's malfunctioning tractor beam! Who knew abduction would be this tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One side of Will's capsule repels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.poster.avif?t=1727266555\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.webm?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/f98fc905d2b3cb876169d4df8bff57c9.mp4?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the other attracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.poster.avif?t=1727266555\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.webm?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050250/extras/014983cb94a5ebb53d46789dfeeb3350.mp4?t=1727266555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To maneuver Will, all you have to do is move your mouse to change his orientation, and right-click to swap the direction of the Forces. Sounds simple enough, right...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the top? Will the school prove too difficult for you to navigate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way to find out if you have the Force of Will.</p>",
    "short_description": "Join Will and his alien mates as they abduct kids from Earth! But disaster strikes when Will\u2019s UFO malfunctions, ejecting him mid-mission. Help him scale objects in the tractor beam back to his ship before it's too late!",
